      "comment": "Yalyane Morevna: Knyazhna of Blood",
      "content": "The title reflects her savage raids on fae kindreds. The General History says she plundered and razed many of them, and the author wonders whether courage began as a crime. The same book notes she never ravaged human clans and, according to The Davograd Chronicles and other accounts, took humans into Hesperides for protection against monsters.",
