      "comment": "Yalyane Morevna: Yalyane and the young Monomakh",
      "content": "She taught the future Belyi Tsar the spear in harsh sessions. She said she had once seen a spear strike that crossed rivers and mountains and smashed demons. Later, seeing rifles, the Tsar decided the spear she described was not meant to be thrown. The Frostbreath story says his supreme spear art differed slightly from her teaching.",
