      "comment": "Yalyane Morevna: The leader's complete soul",
      "content": "A Hesperides document attributes to Morevna the rule that the Snegovik leader must have a complete soul, obtainable only through true love. Larisa sought love to meet it. Pavlina later rose to princess without it and wrote bitterly of the rule.",
